sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Angular deepscrape
  participant A as arachnefly
  participant W as webrain worker
  participant T as Target site

  U->>A: POST /scrape with Bearer token
  A->>A: verify entitlement + quota
  alt over quota
    A-->>U: 429 with retry-after
  else within quota
    A->>W: MCP tools/call over private 6PN
    W->>T: CDP navigate
    T-->>W: DOM plus challenge field
    alt challenge detected
      W-->>A: challenge is non-null
      A-->>U: 409 needs session or real Chrome
    else page rendered clean
      W->>W: zero-LLM extraction
      W-->>A: typed JSON
      A-->>U: typed JSON plus credits consumed
    end
  end
